  // {[97, 75], [125, 97], [103, 125], [75, 103]} and {[103, 75], [125, 103], [97, 125], [75, 97]}. The Anthropos will cast
  // 'Searing Radiance' for light beam and 'Shadowsear' for dark beam. We use those as a trigger for Tower players place
